00:36:26.490 --> 00:36:28.170
And you can just use this.

00:36:28.170 --> 00:36:29.370
So this is really easy.

00:36:29.370 --> 00:36:31.610
I'm just saying
Google credentials

00:36:31.610 --> 00:36:35.140
that get application default
